## PR Title
Allow credit counter to support >=32bit max values/changes.

## PR Description
"fixes #751" - the credit counter now supports MaxValue / MaxChange values that need more than 32 bits of width, instead of silently being capped by an `int` typed parameter. The PR also allows `bin2onehot` to be 1 and reverts the demux bin default to 2.

